   "source": [
    "# Quiz: Introduction to machine learning\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-1-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Applications of machine learning are all around us</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>True</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Machine learning is now used almost everywhere. It is as common as the data from our smart phones and connected devices.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>False</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Machine learning is now used almost everywhere, as common as the data from our smart phones. So the statement is true.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-1-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is the technical difference between classical ML and deep learning?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>classical ML was invented first</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The difference is in how models are built. Deep learning builds many-layered models using neural networks.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>the use of neural networks</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Deep learning means many-layered model-building using neural networks, which this classical ML course leaves out.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>deep learning is used in robots</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The difference is in how models are built. Deep learning uses many layers of neural networks.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-1-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Why might a business want to use ML strategies?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>to automate the solving of multi-dimensional problems</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>to customize a shopping experience based on the type of customer</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>both of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-1-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Machine learning algorithms are meant to simulate</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>intelligent machines</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Machine learning is loosely inspired by how the human brain learns from data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>the human brain</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Machine learning is loosely inspired by how the human brain learns from the data it takes in.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>orangutans</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The inspiration for machine learning is the human brain and how it learns from data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-1-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is an example of a classical ML technique?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>natural language processing</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Natural language processing is one of the classical ML techniques this course teaches.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>deep learning</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Deep learning is listed under what this classical ML course will not cover.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Neural Networks</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Neural networks are on the list of things this classical ML course does not cover.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-1-1-post-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Why should everyone learn the basics of ML?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>learning ML is fun and accessible to everyone</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. True, the course welcomes complete beginners. But knowing ML basics is also becoming a must in every field, so both reasons apply.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>ML strategies are being used in many industries and domains</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. True, many fields use ML. But the course also welcomes complete beginners, so both reasons apply.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>both of the above</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Knowing ML basics is becoming a must in every field, and this course welcomes complete beginners.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
